@startuml
!theme plain
actor Driver
participant "Driver view\n/driver" as UI
participant "DriverController" as API
participant "RouteSendService" as SVC
participant "RouteComplianceService" as LEZ
database "MySQL" as DB

title D06 S-2 Driver lists and opens sent routes

Driver -> UI: log in (role DRIVER)
UI -> API: GET /api/v1/driver/routes
API -> SVC: mySends()
SVC -> SVC: requireDriver() (403 if not DRIVER)
SVC -> DB: own sends: CURRENT first, then SUPERSEDED
SVC --> API: RouteSendDTO[]
API --> UI: list of sends

Driver -> UI: open one send
UI -> API: GET /api/v1/driver/routes/{sendId}
API -> SVC: sendDetail(sendId)
alt unknown sendId
  SVC --> API: 400 + 0040402
else another driver's send
  SVC --> API: 403 + 0040301
else own send
  SVC -> DB: route stops, orders (customer, phone, notes)
  SVC -> LEZ: currentFor(solution) -> zone names per stop
  SVC --> API: DriverRouteDTO (stops in plan order,\nlegs and instructions, zone names only)
end
API --> UI: render stops and map

note over UI, API
  Read-only: no driver endpoint changes a send, a stop or an order.
end note
@enduml
